            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.7.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[0.7 is the release line with the chat view for Pi and the list view, both first shipped in the 0.6.20 beta.

### New
- **Migrate a running task.** "Migrate to" is now offered for every task with a session, even while its agent runs. The sheet stops the agent when you confirm, and asks first unless the agent is idle. If the new agent fails to start, the task returns to its previous session, which you can resume.

### Changed
- **List view: click selects, double-click opens.** A single click no longer jumps into the terminal or chat. Task Details for the selected row are on the toolbar button and under Edit Task in the context menu.
- The selected row in the list view is highlighted in the accent color.
]]></description>
